  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/02/IMG_2721.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La bibioteca infantil de Onda ha iniciado la tarde de este lunes las actividades del a&ntilde;o Platero, con la elaboraci&oacute;n&nbsp;de un pictograma sobre el libro Platero y yo, cuando se cumplen 100 a&ntilde;os de la edici&oacute;n del libro de Juan Ram&oacute;n Jim&eacute;nez.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicianyplaterobibliotecainfantilonda/img_2715.jpg\" alt=\"img_2715\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicianyplaterobibliotecainfantilonda/img_2716.jpg\" alt=\"img_2716\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicianyplaterobibliotecainfantilonda/img_2717.jpg\" alt=\"img_2717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicianyplaterobibliotecainfantilonda/img_2718.jpg\" alt=\"img_2718\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicianyplaterobibliotecainfantilonda/img_2719.jpg\" alt=\"img_2719\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicianyplaterobibliotecainfantilonda/img_2720.jpg\" alt=\"img_2720\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicianyplaterobibliotecainfantilonda/img_2721.jpg\" alt=\"img_2721\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicianyplaterobibliotecainfantilonda/img_2722.jpg\" alt=\"img_2722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicianyplatero